---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Wills & estates"
  description="Wills, trusts, executor services and deceased estates in Centurion and Pretoria, from an attorney who has wound up estates for years."
  legal
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Wills &amp; estates</h1>
    <p>
      A will is not paperwork. It decides who looks after your children, who gets the house, and how long your
      family waits for money. I draft wills, set up trusts, act as executor, and wind up deceased estates.
    </p>

    <h2>What I do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Wills, drafted and checked by an attorney</li>
      <li>Trusts for children and family property</li>
      <li>Executor services and the administration of deceased estates</li>
      <li>Help for families reporting a death to the Master</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Fees</h2>
    <p>
      Executor fees are set by law at up to 3.5% of the gross value of the estate, plus VAT, and they are negotiable.
      Will drafting: <span class="todo">[FEE]</span>.
    </p>

    <h2>If someone has just died</h2>
    <p>
      Start with the <a href="/report-a-death">checklist for reporting a death</a>: the documents the Master's office
      asks for, in the order you'll need them.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
